            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.322,
                0.311,
                0.706,
                0.326
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图 9-1 研磨大鼠肝脏的步骤（引自 Celis，2006）"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.368,
            0.894,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.173,
                0.329,
                0.855,
                0.345
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "A. 在冰冻的缓冲液 C 中将大鼠肝脏剪碎；B 和 C. 通过金属筛轻轻地压肝脏；D. 接收筛上的研磨液"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.138,
                0.368,
                0.894,
                0.538
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_4_image_8.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.227,
                0.554,
                0.8,
                0.57
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "图 9-2 利用蔗糖浓度梯度从大鼠肝脏中分离纯化高尔基体（Celis，2006）"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image_footnote",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.138,
                0.573,
                0.891,
                0.644
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "A. 首先将肝脏匀浆液加在 0.86mol/L 蔗糖（缓冲液 D）的上层，然后用 0.25mol/L 蔗糖溶液（缓冲液 B）覆盖其上。左边的字母指示用来制造梯度的蔗糖缓冲液；B. 超速离心后，高尔基体在 0.5/0.86mol/L 交界处富集；C. 从第一个梯度中粗提取的高尔基体样本被转移到第二个梯度中；D. 离心后，高尔基体在 0.5/1.3mol/L 界面处形成了一个微弱的带并且可以用巴斯德移液器进行收集"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.661,
            0.461,
            0.68
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）加入 4.5ml 研磨液覆盖其上。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.683,
            0.849,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）加入 1.8ml 缓冲液 B 覆盖其上并平衡每一支管的重量，误差在 0.01g 之内。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.705,
            0.559,
            0.723
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 下，以 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "29000\\mathrm{r / min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 离心 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "60\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.727,
            0.908,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 弃去位于上层和胞质中的脂肪 (由于红细胞的存在而显红色), 并使用塑料巴斯特移液器收集在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.5 / 0.86 \\mathrm{~mol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 界面 (出现模糊带) 富集的高尔基体片段 (图 9-2B)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.77,
            0.91,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 把高尔基体片段收集在一支 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Falcon 管中。通常, 收集溶液的总体积约为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 折射系数大约为 1.370 (0.77 mol/L 蔗糖溶液)。保留 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "200 \\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 置于冰上用作酶测定实验, 使用缓冲液 A 把高尔基体样品置于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.25 \\mathrm{~mol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 蔗糖溶液中 (折射系数 1.345)。如果有必要, 用缓冲液 B 补充溶液至 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.858,
            0.91,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(9) 对于第二个梯度 (图 9-2C), 在每一支管中加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 缓冲液 C 后, 接着加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 缓冲液 E, 再加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "8 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 稀释的高尔基体片段覆盖其上。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 5,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.382,
            0.052,
            0.618,
            0.068
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第九章 细胞化学成分的分离"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.826,
            0.052,
            0.861,
            0.066
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "135"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.088,
            0.538,
            0.106
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(10) 在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 下, 以 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "8000 \\mathrm{r} / \\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 离心 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.109,
            0.894,
            0.171
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(11) 弃去上清液并且收集在 0.5/1.3mol/L 蔗糖溶液界面处的高尔基体膜（弱带）（图 9-2D）。轻轻地将高尔基体膜（1.5～2ml）与 1 倍体积缓冲液 A 混匀。最终体积为 3～4ml。利用 Bradford 实验（Bio-Rad）检测蛋白质浓度，通常浓度为 1～2mg/ml。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.173,
            0.896,
            0.214
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（12）将样品置于液氮中冷冻然后贮存在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-80^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。样品可以冻融2次而不会导致酶活性显著降低和失去形态。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.225,
            0.537,
            0.246
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（二） "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta-1,4-"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 半乳糖转移酶活性的检测"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.258,
            0.231,
            0.277
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 溶液配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.279,
            0.897,
            0.32
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.4 \\mathrm{~mol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲肿酸钠, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{pH} 6.6"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "; 将 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "17.1 \\mathrm{~g}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲肿酸钠溶解在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "150 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 水中, 用 HCl 调节 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{pH}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 到 6.6。定容至 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "200 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 并在室温下保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.322,
            0.898,
            0.363
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "175\\mathrm{mg / ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 卵类黏蛋白:溶解 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\mathrm{g}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 于水中并最终加水至 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5.7\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。用 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.45\\mu \\mathrm{m}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 滤膜进行过滤，制成标准溶液并在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-20^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.365,
            0.898,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 10mmol/L UDP-半乳糖苷酶: 将 25mg 粉末溶解在 4.4ml 水中, 制成标准溶液并在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-20^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.407,
            0.898,
            0.448
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 10% (w/V) Triton X-100: 将 10g 粉末溶解在 80ml 水中, 最终定容至 100ml, 在 4℃保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.45,
            0.898,
            0.49
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 0.2mol/L ATP: 将 605mg ATP 溶解在 3ml 水中，用 1mol/L NaOH 调 pH 至 6.5~7.0 并用水最终定容至 5ml。制成标准溶液并在 -20℃ 保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.493,
            0.845,
            0.511
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\mathrm{~mol} / \\mathrm{L} \\mathrm{MnCl}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ": 将 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9.9 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{MnCl}_{2} \\cdot 4 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 溶解到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 水中, 在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.514,
            0.9,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 1%磷钨酸/0.5mol/L HCl (PTA/HCl): 把 5g 磷钨酸溶解在 400ml 水中, 加 22ml 浓 HCl 并用水定容至 500ml, 4℃保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.557,
            0.866,
            0.575
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 5% (w/V) SDS: 将 5g SDS 溶解到 80ml 水中，定容至 100ml，4℃保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.578,
            0.9,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(9) 2mol/L Tris: 将 24.2gTris 溶解在 70ml 水中, 最后定容至 100ml, 室温下保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.621,
            0.903,
            0.704
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（10）测定混合液:使用前述的药品制备一批测定混合液:200μl甲胂酸钠，6μl巯基乙醇，200μl卵类黏蛋白，40μl UDP-半乳糖苷酶，40μl Triton X-100，20μl ATP，40μl MnCl₂，10μl [³H] UDP-半乳糖苷酶和1040μl水。在混合液中UDP-半乳糖苷酶的浓度为0.25mmol/L。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.707,
            0.236,
            0.725
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 实验步骤"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.727,
            0.891,
            0.746
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 当高尔基体制备完成时, 配制 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1: 20"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的匀浆液, 中间液和高尔基体裂解用水。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.749,
            0.901,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 往装有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 稀释样品或水（空白对照）的螺母型 Eppendorf 管中加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "80\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 测定混合液（重复实验）。在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 条件下转动温育 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.792,
            0.88,
            0.811
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 加入 1ml 冰冻 PTA/HCl 溶液停止反应，并在 13000r/min 速度下离心 10s。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.814,
            0.875,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 弃上清液，并加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{ml} \\mathrm{PTA} / \\mathrm{HCl}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。按步骤（3）中的方法重新悬浮沉淀物。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.835,
            0.904,
            0.875
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（5）吸取并丢弃上清液。加入 1ml 冰冻的 95% 乙醇并按步骤（4）重新悬浮沉淀物。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.877,
            0.905,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 按步骤 (3) 进行离心, 弃上清液。加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50 \\mu \\mathrm{l} 2 \\mathrm{~mol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Tris, 然后加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "200 \\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 6,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.054,
            0.186,
            0.067
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "136"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.429,
            0.052,
            0.595,
            0.068
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.087,
            0.559,
            0.105
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5%SDS 进行重新悬浮。震动直到沉淀完全溶解。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.109,
            0.906,
            0.17
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（7）在1支干净的离心管中加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 测定混合液（包含2.5nmol UDP-半乳糖苷酶），"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "40\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 水和 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "200\\mu \\mathrm{l}5\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " SDS。这一步骤确保了混合液中 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left[^{3}\\mathrm{H}\\right]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " UDP-半乳糖苷酶特异性活性。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.173,
            0.835,
            0.192
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 在每个样本中加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 闪烁液。转动并使用闪烁计数器的氚通道计数。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.207,
            0.417,
            0.226
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（三）蛋白质浓度的确定"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.241,
            0.907,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 当 GalT 实验正在进行温育时, 用水配制以下三个样本的稀释液: ①匀浆液进行 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1:100"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 稀释; ②中间片段进行 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1:20"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 稀释; ③高尔基体段进行 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1:2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 稀释。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.285,
            0.742,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 制备稀释的 Bio-Rad 蛋白质测定溶液（用水进行 5 倍稀释）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.306,
            0.909,
            0.367
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）将每一管稀释样品分装 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 小试管中，用 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 水作为空白对照。同样地分装 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\mu \\mathrm{l}0.1\\mathrm{mg / ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.2\\mathrm{mg / ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.4\\mathrm{mg / ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 和 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.8\\mathrm{mg / ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 小牛血清（BSA）作标准曲线。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.37,
            0.905,
            0.389
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "990\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 稀释的Bio-Rad蛋白质测定溶液，充分混匀，在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "595\\mathrm{nm}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 处测定吸收光。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.401,
            0.397,
            0.421
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（四）纯化表格的计算"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.434,
            0.909,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）通过测定每管不同浓度 BSA 的吸收值描点制定蛋白质的标准曲线。计算斜率  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(m)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  并在纵坐标轴  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(c)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  截取值。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.276,
            0.476,
            0.755,
            0.511
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_12.jpg",
          "content": "\\text {蛋白质浓度} (\\mathrm{mg/ml}) = \\frac {(\\text {样品吸收光} - c) \\times \\text {稀释倍数}}{m}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.517,
            0.66,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "总蛋白质量（mg）=蛋白质浓度（mg/ml）×体积（ml）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.538,
            0.806,
            0.556
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 计算测定混合液中的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left[{ }^{3} \\mathrm{H}\\right]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " UDP-半乳糖苷酶的特异性活性（SA）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.242,
            0.56,
            0.789,
            0.595
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_15.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathrm{SA} \\left[ ^ {3} \\mathrm{H} \\right] \\text {UDP - 半乳糖苷酶 (dpm / nmol)} = \\frac {\\mathrm{dpm 标准一空白}}{2 . 5 \\mathrm{nmol}}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.6,
            0.909,
            0.64
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10μl 测定混合液中包含 2.5nmol ["
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "^{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "H] UDP-半乳糖苷酶 [β-1,4-半乳糖转移酶活性的检测步骤 (7)]。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.643,
            0.484,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 计算每一样品中 GalT 的活性:"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.665,
            0.88,
            0.702
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_18.jpg",
          "content": "\\frac {\\mathrm{GalT活性浓度}}{\\left[ \\mathrm{nmol/(h} \\cdot \\mathrm{ml)} \\right]} = \\frac {\\text {平均dpm一空白对照}}{\\mathrm{SA} \\left[ ^ 3 \\mathrm{H} \\right] \\mathrm{UDP-半乳糖苷酶}} \\times \\frac {1}{0 . 0 2 \\mathrm{ml}} \\times \\frac {1}{0 . 5 \\mathrm{h}} \\times 2 0 (\\text {稀释因子})"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.706,
            0.823,
            0.724
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "总 GalT 活性 (nmol/h)=GalT 活性浓度 [nmol/(h·ml)] × 体积 (ml)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.727,
            0.911,
            0.788
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）通过除以在  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C 下与其蛋白质浓度相同的样品计算在  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C 条件下 GalT 每个分子每小时每升的 SA [以 GalT 浓度除以同一样品的蛋白质浓度计算 GalT 的 AS，达到 nmol/(mg·h)]。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.791,
            0.911,
            0.831
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（5）高尔基体膜的产量可根据高尔基体片段中 GalT 的总活性和匀浆液中 GalT 的总活性比值计算出来。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.834,
            0.81,
            0.852
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 纯化倍数是反映 GalT 的 SA 在高尔基体片段相对于匀浆液的因子。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.855,
            0.911,
            0.896
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "表 9-2 是使用 10 个分离纯化结果而编辑的，每一个参数以平均值±SEM 的形式呈现。因此特异性活性，产量和纯化倍数仅仅是在算数上与 GalT 和蛋白质浓度相关。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
