                0.106
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "表 9-2 中间片段制备溶浆液中高尔基体标记 β-1,4-半乳糖转移酶（GalT）的富集"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.119,
                0.108,
                0.898,
                0.225
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_7_table_3.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>片 段</td><td>体积/ml</td><td>[蛋白质]/(mg/ml)</td><td>总GalT/(nmol/h)</td><td>特异性活性/[nmol/(h·mg)]</td><td>GalT产量/%</td><td>纯化/倍</td></tr><tr><td>匀浆液</td><td>48.4±2.7</td><td>103±16</td><td>26 000±700</td><td>5.3±1.4</td><td>100.0</td><td>1.0</td></tr><tr><td>0.5/0.86mol/L</td><td>17.6±2.1</td><td>12.9±3.9</td><td>5 350±360</td><td>23.6±1.6</td><td>20.2±1.2</td><td>4.5±0.4</td></tr><tr><td>界面</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>高尔基体</td><td>4.6±0.6</td><td>1.5±0.2</td><td>3 560±160</td><td>520±22.8</td><td>13.7±0.4</td><td>97.4±4.2</td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.245,
            0.32,
            0.265
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（五）检测结果"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.279,
            0.904,
            0.383
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "如表 9-2 描述的一样，这一实验通常可从匀浆液中提取 80～100 倍纯化的高尔基体。根据 β-1,4-半乳糖转移酶（Landegren，1984）和鱼藤酮非敏感 NADH-细胞色素 c 还原酶（Sottocasa et al.，1967）实验，高尔基体制备包含非常少溶酶体和内质网成分。这些高尔基体膜折叠的状态可用电子显微镜检测（图 9-3）。按 Pypaert 等（1991）描述的方法将样品固定在悬浮液中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.245,
            0.396,
            0.495,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.245,
                0.396,
                0.495,
                0.616
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_7_image_6.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.522,
            0.396,
            0.774,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.522,
                0.396,
                0.774,
                0.616
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_7_image_7.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.158,
                0.629,
                0.86,
